## Why This Is Asked

Tests incident response and decision making under uncertainty in ML-enabled products, ensuring cross-functional alignment and concrete rollback/patch strategies.

## Key Concepts

- Data drift detection and drift thresholds
- Risk budget and acceptance criteria
- Rollback vs patch vs slow-roll trade-offs
- Cross-functional triage and clear decision documentation
- Postmortem and learning actions

## Code Example

```javascript
function decideAction(metrics, thresholds){
  if(metrics.drift > thresholds.drift || metrics.fp > thresholds.fp) return 'rollback';
  if(metrics.latency > thresholds.latency) return 'patch';
  return 'slow-roll';
}
```

